# Image contents = the Linux release tarball's paths (#962). Whitelist, so a
# dirty working tree (project data, camera-model bulk, build output) can't
# leak into an image.
*
!desktop/shared
!desktop/linux
!firmware/registry.json
!firmware/orangepi
!docs/help
!docs/schema
!docs/USER_MANUAL*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
desktop/shared/data
firmware/orangepi/models
